    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Putting Ono's advice into action right away, Muranishi stops outside the grandest house in the neighborhood. He showers the lady of the house with compliments and English loanwords—until her intimidating husband Nakai steps out and orders him inside. Listen to how flattery opens the gate.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すごい家ですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "okusama",
      "t": "何よ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あまりにビューティフォーだったので驚いてしまいました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "okusama",
      "t": "お上手ね。でもセールスなら結構ですから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いやあ、それは残念ですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "スペシャルな商品なんですが。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "okusama",
      "t": "どんな商品なの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "少しだけお話を聞いていただけますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "どうしたの？俺にも聞かせてくれよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "早く入れよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "どんな特別な商品なんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "英会話教材です。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Notice how Muranishi mixes humble requests with playful katakana English, while Nakai barks gruff commands. Let's walk through it.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すごい家ですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What an amazing house.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あまりにビューティフォーだったので驚いてしまいました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You were so beautiful that I was completely startled.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "okusama",
      "t": "お上手ね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
